    "List layout failure cannot enter text-only synchronization. The actual semantic DOM kind is checked before an original text getter is called.",
    "The existing deferred original engine layout scheduler/invalidator is shared by button metrics and list recovery. List retries are coalesced per control, and clear on ownership release. No NSScrollView or selection/scroll/layout implementation is added.",
